    "Every day of Ramadan logged as not fasted is added to what you owe, and every make-up fast kept takes one off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every day of Ramadan logged as not fasted is added to what you owe, and every make-up fast kept takes one off."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "كل يوم من رمضان يُسجَّل دون صيام يُضاف إلى القضاء، وكل يوم قضاء يُصام يُخصم منه."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every day you have recorded, with each prayer, sunnah prayer, azkar session, tasbih count and fast and when it was logged, as a spreadsheet file. To move your data to another device, use the backup in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every day you have recorded, with each prayer, sunnah prayer, azkar session, tasbih count and fast and when it was logged, as a spreadsheet file. To move your data to another device, use the backup in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "كل يوم سجَّلته، بكل صلاة وسنّة وجلسة أذكار وعدّ تسبيح وصيام ووقت تسجيله، في ملف جدول بيانات. ولنقل بياناتك إلى جهاز آخر استخدم النسخة الاحتياطية في الإعدادات."
          }
        }
      }
    },
